  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SMEF- Idea Management and Innovation System</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to address the challenge of limited innovation in Lesotho, especially within government departments. It proposes an Idea Management and Innovation System to foster collaboration, break down silos, and tap into the untapped potential of the workforce, particularly the youth. The initiative targets youth, with a focus on girls, in all ten districts of Lesotho, aiming to encourage their innovative ideas and contribute to national development. The project aligns with UNESCO&amp;#39;s goals of sustainable development, gender equality, and fostering creativity. Overall, it seeks to create a culture of innovation and problem-solving for the benefit of the entire community.</narrative>
  </description>
